  ('cooking-for-yourself', 360, 'Choose your next small kitchen goal, like a new soup or a new egg dish, and write it on the grocery list.'),
  ('cooking-for-yourself', 361, 'Keep your easiest staples stocked by adding them to the list each time one gets low.'),
  ('cooking-for-yourself', 362, 'Plan a meal for someone you love using a recipe you have now made more than once.'),
